Allright, folks, PC NetHack 2.3e binaries are in the newsgroup
comp.binaries.ibm.pc now.  (3 out of 11 parts have been posted so far
at my site.)  Anyone who still hasn't FTP'd the files from grape can
get the game there.  Just save all the parts for the support files (2)
in files called "nhacksup.uu?", substituting the part number for the ?,
and the executable parts in files called "nhack23e.uu?".  Then make a
shell script with the following in it:

#! /bin/sh
cat $* | sed '/^END/,/^BEGIN/d'| uudecode

and use chmod to make it executable, and then enter the commands:

combine nhacksup.uu?
combine nhack23e.uu?

Or edit the files by hand, removing everything between and including
the ^BEGIN and ^END lines and concatenate the parts by hand, then
uudecode the resulting files.

You now have two ARC format archives with everything you need to set
the game up on your PC.

So will all you guys stop filling my mailbox with "I can't wait for the
game to be posted..." requests!  :-)  :-)  :-)

